{"c":[{"id":"40c277ae98ccebf5","sum":"A repeating SwiftUI KeyframeAnimator redraws every frame even off screen (perch blink+breath cost 10.9% of a core; one-shot Timer blinks ~1%). The host's debug-socket JSON omits nil optionals, so scripts test == null, not === null.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T213409Z-2c06a8e735f40a5c","text":"A repeating SwiftUI KeyframeAnimator redraws every frame, even through long holds and in a panel never ordered on screen: the perch's 5 s blink plus breath cost the host 10.9% of a core; one-shot blinks on a Timer cost about 1%.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T213409Z-cab3b62b740f0600","text":"The host's debug-socket JSON omits nil optionals (Swift JSONEncoder), so scripts must test == null / undefined, not === null.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"b1c45b8f5a3c01de","sum":"Tests: in XCTestCase subclasses a free function record(...) is shadowed by XCTestCase.record(_:), so name builders taskRecord. Perch/taskControl checks run with nothing on screen: real Helper with helper/test/fake-app.ts as readerLink, host --perch hidden --allow-pids 5150.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T213409Z-d226423d62147f07","text":"In XCTestCase subclasses a free function named record(...) is shadowed by XCTestCase.record(_:); name test builders taskRecord or similar.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T213410Z-c55d0036facdd019","text":"Perch and taskControl checks can run with nothing on screen: real Helper in process with helper/test/fake-app.ts as readerLink, host with --perch hidden and --allow-pids 5150 (no such process).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
